{"_id":"68874bebd935cc29f5de30ee","title":"Better Drawing","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a4639417ec360a6eea8f6ba2dc7983f035f7bfd71ab45bcc7f03a259807782a2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1753697259125.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a4639417ec360a6eea8f6ba2dc7983f035f7bfd71ab45bcc7f03a259807782a2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1753697259125.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Better-Drawing-46636","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":12930,"executes":769,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/40335334715ec60f3e2f05f69bf5d6e35d5c85b06cf0768b87f050d6ad1fb92e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1753697259125.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1753697259125.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/40335334715ec60f3e2f05f69bf5d6e35d5c85b06cf0768b87f050d6ad1fb92e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1753697259125.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1753697259125.png"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-07-28T10:07:39.288Z","updatedAt":"2025-07-28T10:07:39.288Z","lastBump":"2025-07-28T10:07:39.288Z","script":"-- example ussage:\nlocal BetterDrawing = loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dementiaenjoyer/Better-Drawing/refs/heads/main/Main.lua\"))();\n\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\");\nlocal Workspace = game:GetService(\"Workspace\");\n\nlocal Camera = Workspace.CurrentCamera;\nlocal LocalPlayer = Players.LocalPlayer;\n\nlocal Round = math.round;\n\nlocal function Update()\n    for _, Player in Players:GetChildren() do\n        local Character = Player.Character;\n        local Root = Character and Character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\");\n\n        if (not Root) or (Player == LocalPlayer) then\n            continue;\n        end\n\n        local ScreenPosition, OnScreen = Camera:WorldToViewportPoint(Root.Position - Vector3.new(0, 0.5, 0));\n        local Distance = ScreenPosition.Z;\n\n        if (not OnScreen) then\n            continue;\n        end\n\n        local Scale = (2 * Camera.ViewportSize.Y) / ((2 * Distance * math.tan(math.rad(Camera.FieldOfView) / 2)) * 1.5); -- Found this somewhere cant remember where\n\n        local Width, Height = Round(3 * Scale), Round(4 * Scale);\n        local Size = Vector2.new(Width, Height);\n\n        local Position = Vector2.new(Round(ScreenPosition.X - (Width / 2)), Round(ScreenPosition.Y - (Height / 2)));\n\n        local Outline = Drawing.new(\"Square\");\n        Outline.Visible = true;\n\n        local Box = Drawing.new(\"Square\");\n        Box.Visible = true;\n        \n        -- Box\n        do\n            Box.Color = Color3.new(1, 1, 1);\n            Box.Thickness = 1;\n\n            Box.Size = Size;\n            Box.Position = Position;\n        end\n\n        -- Outline\n        do\n            Outline.Color = Color3.new(0, 0, 0);\n            Outline.Thickness = 3;\n\n            Outline.Position = Box.Position;\n            Outline.Size = Box.Size;\n        end\n    end\nend\n\nBetterDrawing:Init(Update);","features":"What is Better-Drawing?\n\nBetter-Drawing is a custom wrapper for Roblox's Drawing API that makes it way easier to work with visuals like ESPs, boxes, text, and more.\n\nThe main benefit is that it automatically handles cleanup so you don’t have to manually remove elements or clear them every frame. Once you're done using a drawing (like when a player disappears), it gets deleted automatically. That means cleaner code and fewer performance issues.\n\nCredits to dementia enjoyer check out his GitHub here:\nhttps://github.com/dementiaenjoyer/Better-Drawing","tags":["better drawing","esp","cache","roblox","easyier esp"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"677be435ea4516cd66668ea7","username":"CatBoy","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4b6fb37706d5f7244291c27fd67e992441678f96672d2dbd77a00b5b52457e79.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/677be435ea4516cd66668ea7-1749212341564.png"},"status":"offline","id":"677be435ea4516cd66668ea7","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":50},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4b6fb37706d5f7244291c27fd67e992441678f96672d2dbd77a00b5b52457e79.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/677be435ea4516cd66668ea7-1749212341564.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-23T02:58:07.217Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"68874bebd935cc29f5de30f0","editBy":{"_id":"677be435ea4516cd66668ea7","username":"CatBoy","status":"offline","id":"677be435ea4516cd66668ea7"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-07-28T10:07:39.292Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6887e9553c6d3ea9d683d132","commentBy":{"_id":"622675c0a476a5e7b39c3f20","username":"Onzabirr","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2022-03-07T21:14:40.043Z","lastActive":"2026-10-13T01:23:54.723Z","lvl":8,"status":"offline","id":"622675c0a476a5e7b39c3f20","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"This is cool","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-07-28T21:19:17.614Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"688a7f0a7d084186c2257573","commentBy":{"_id":"686a00105ff8bc43bd7448b6","username":"gorillatagplayer555","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.